# `xrandr --output VNC-0 --mode 1680x1050` -- the five requests between and
# including GrabServer and UngrabServer, lifted from recon/wire/trace_rr2.log
# connection 2 (requests 19-23), captured 2026-09-10 against the box's own
# :355 through recon/wire/proxy.py. RANDR major 140 there, root 0x22b, crtc
# 0x3a, output 0x3b, mode 0x3f = 1680x1050, config timestamp 0x304a204b.
#
# One line per request, in the order they were sent:
#   GrabServer
#   SetCrtcConfig  crtc 0x3a, mode None, outputs []          <- the disable
#   SetScreenSize  root, 1680x1050, 469mm x 293mm
#   SetCrtcConfig  crtc 0x3a, mode 0x3f, outputs [0x3b]      <- the enable
#   UngrabServer
#
# The order disable -> SetScreenSize -> enable is fixed whichever way the
# framebuffer moves: measured in both directions, 1920x1080 <-> 1680x1050
# [recon/wire.md 6], and confirmed in xrandr.c:1680 apply().
